      "message": "A Integration test case should be added to ThreadIntegrationTest to check that the latest country code is set to ot-daemon when ot-daemon has been restarted. For example:\n\n```\n    @Test\n    public void otDaemonRestart_latestCountryCodeIsSetToOtDaemon() throws Exception {\n        runThreadCommand(\"force-country-code enabled CN\");\n        runShellCommand(\"stop ot-daemon\");\n\n        // Use ot-ctl command to check that the expected country code is set\n    }\n```",
